Third-party components used by sample-lerobot-policy-finetuning-on-sagemaker
============================================================================

The code in this repository is released under MIT-0 (see LICENSE). This file lists the components this repository's
own code depends on, in the training image and in the laptop-side tooling, with the licence each component declares.
The complete set installed in the image, including everything the Deep Learning Containers base brings with it, is
trainer/sagemaker/requirements.lock; run `pip show <package>` inside the image to confirm a licence. With two
exceptions, nothing below is redistributed by this repository: the image is built in your account from public package
indexes and the AWS Deep Learning Containers registry; base model weights, where a policy uses any, are downloaded into
your account at run time (see docs/POLICIES.md).

The exceptions are the two Lambda handler runtimes under cdk/template/assets/: kickoff-handler/index.js (the
AwsCustomResource handler) and s3-auto-delete-handler/index.js (the S3 auto-delete provider). aws-cdk-lib 2.268.0
generates both at synth time; they are committed as unmodified minified output so the no-Node CloudFormation path can
deploy without running `cdk`. Both are Copyright 2018-2026 Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (source project: https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk); the NOTICE attribution is reproduced
below, before the licence text.

