| torchvision ResNet18 weights (ImageNet-1k pre-training, pre-staged file) | BSD-3-Clause code; ImageNet data terms apply to the dataset, not to these weights, per common practice; set `pretrained_backbone_weights: null` in the policy overrides for a zero-external-weights build | ACT / Diffusion backbone init |

