Datasets referenced
-------------------
| dataset | licence | use |
|---|---|---|
| lerobot/svla_so101_pickplace | Apache-2.0 | the shipped quick-start example (downloaded by the pipeline, never vendored) |
| hjkso1406/so101-4tasks-100eps | Apache-2.0 as a dataset-card tag only (no LICENSE file, anonymous uploader; accept it yourself, see docs/DATASETS.md) | per-policy dataset of the language-conditioned entries in project_config.json (evo1, molmoact2, lingbot_va, pi0_fast, eo1, fastwam) and of the VLA smokes; downloaded by the pipeline when those policies are enabled, never vendored |
| lerobot/xarm_lift_medium | MIT | reward-labelled per-policy dataset of the tdmpc entry in project_config.json; downloaded by the pipeline when enabled, never vendored |

Model weights
-------------
This repository ships no model weights. ACT, Diffusion Policy and VQ-BeT train from scratch. Every other registry entry
names its base checkpoint and its licence class in trainer/policies/<policy>.yaml and docs/POLICIES.md; those weights stay
under their publisher's licence and are fetched into your account only when you enable the policy and accept the terms.

